We will build a mini autonomous agent (AutoGPT-style) where the LLM can:

• plan steps
• choose tools
• observe results
• decide the next step
• stop when the goal is complete

This is the reason → act → observe loop used in most modern agent systems.

Autonomous Agent Architecture

Think of it like this:

User Goal
   ↓
LLM Planner
   ↓
Choose Action (tool)
   ↓
Execute Tool
   ↓
Observation
   ↓
LLM decides next step
   ↓
Repeat until done

This loop is the core of AutoGPT, LangGraph agents, OpenAI agents, etc.